# REQUIREMENTS: cu-010

Mirror cu-011 into the enrichment tree, with one extra dependency. Enrichment calls the `opencode` binary as a child process, so a missing or non-executable binary is a startup dependency failure exactly like an unreachable broker, and it is detected by the same gate. The CliReadinessProbe port is declared in application/ports and its adapter sits in infrastructure/llm-data-enricher beside OpenCodeCliClient.
